  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RU &#x2013; EDEN partnership development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We would like to apply for the partnership development fund in order to bring three members of Eden to Denmark in August 2024. The purpose is to strengthen cooperation between our project groups, develop our next project, increase awareness of the project in Radikal Ungdom and give the members of Eden knowledge about how Radikal Ungdom organises major events in Denmark. Specifically, we plan to have one part of the visit consist of workshops, meetings and talks, where we work on our shared project, and another part of the visit will include a visit to Radikal Ungdom annual congress.</narrative>
  </description>
